{"5059040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Game Arena X", "steam_appid": 5059040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5059040/extras/f7d3f18bc4590ec9c4de4f301e03d929.avif?t=1787670121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5059040/extras_big/f7d3f18bc4590ec9c4de4f301e03d929.webp?t=1787670121 width=1560 height=447 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Arena X</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ultimate Skill-Based Competitive Gaming Platform</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Game Arena X</strong>—a competitive gaming platform built for players who believe that <strong>skill should determine the winner</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete across multiple game genres, challenge players from around the world, climb the rankings, and prove that you have what it takes to become a true champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5059040/extras/a59058ab8976b4046a179a8a40d5d4f7.avif?t=1787670121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5059040/extras_big/a59058ab8976b4046a179a8a40d5d4f7.webp?t=1787670121 width=1560 height=447 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill Comes First</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Arena X is designed around one core principle: <strong>your abilities matter</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory isn't decided by luck. Every match rewards strategic thinking, mechanical skill, quick reactions, and smart decision-making. Improve your performance, master your favorite games, and rise through increasingly competitive opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5059040/extras/b24171bfb0608dc5627c8012deffe5d8.avif?t=1787670121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5059040/extras_big/b24171bfb0608dc5627c8012deffe5d8.webp?t=1787670121 width=1560 height=447 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Competitive Games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a growing collection of competitive experiences, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical FPS shooters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-speed racing competitions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action-packed multiplayer battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision-based challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future game modes and tournaments added through regular updates</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter your preferred genre, <strong>Game Arena X</strong> offers new opportunities to compete and improve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5059040/extras/d89603b8aa3928f8dca688923eb34f20.avif?t=1787670121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5059040/extras_big/d89603b8aa3928f8dca688923eb34f20.webp?t=1787670121 width=1560 height=447 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compete Against Real Players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face players from around the globe in online multiplayer matches designed for balanced competition. Every game presents a new challenge as you test your skills against opponents with different playstyles and strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5059040/extras/e22a8b5ec4e99ace728eaffa6239239e.avif?t=1787670121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5059040/extras_big/e22a8b5ec4e99ace728eaffa6239239e.webp?t=1787670121 width=1560 height=447 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Constant Evolution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The platform continues to expand with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New competitive games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Performance optimizations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ongoing content updates</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every update brings fresh opportunities to compete and discover new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5059040/extras/7c2f87942e383c48a65096a21d50f626.avif?t=1787670121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5059040/extras_big/7c2f87942e383c48a65096a21d50f626.webp?t=1787670121 width=1560 height=447 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built for Competitive Players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you enjoy short competitive sessions or long gaming marathons, <strong>Game Arena X</strong> delivers an experience focused on excitement, progression, and replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with confidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Game Arena X</strong>—where every match is another chance to prove yourself.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5059040/extras/f7d3f18bc4590ec9c4de4f301e03d929.avif?t=1787670121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5059040/extras_big/f7d3f18bc4590ec9c4de4f301e03d929.webp?t=178767012